--- !u!114 &353089688
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 353089687}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4f33c25d49a99e74da7e5717feeb8add, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  cutscenePause: 1
  topicDialogues:
  - topic: Reducing energy consumption in software systems
    bossLine1: So I noticed that the system is burning far too much power, and we're
      getting some complaints.
    developerLine1: "Yeah, we\u2019ve noticed unusual spikes in energy use across
      multiple modules."
    bossLine2: "This isn\u2019t acceptable. It's increasing costs and effecting our
      sustainability goals."
    developerLine2: Lets go over some of the issues with our energy consumption,
      and I'll come up with some solutions!
  - topic: Maintainable and scalable software architectures
    bossLine1: I was going through the system architecture, and I think we could
      use some work on the design.
    developerLine1: Oh? What kind of issues did you notice?
    bossLine2: It seems our system isn't very maintainable or scalable, could you
      give me some info on ways to help with this?
    developerLine2: Sure, lets go over some of the issues with our design, and I'll
      come up with some solutions!
  - topic: Cost efficiency and resource optimization in software
    bossLine1: I've noticed the cost efficiency and resource optimization of our
      system is lacking.
    developerLine1: Hmm, what kind of things did you notice?
    bossLine2: It seems our software isn't reducing costs and resource usage like
      we hoped, could you give me some info on ways to help with this?
    developerLine2: Sure, lets go over some of the issues with our design, and I'll
      come up with some solutions!
  - topic: Accessibility and user well-being in software
    bossLine1: I've noticed our system's accessibility isn't as strong as our stakeholders
      were expecting.
    developerLine1: Huh, what did they mention?
    bossLine2: It seems our software doesn't consider user well-being enough, could
      you give me some info on ways to help with this?
    developerLine2: Sure, lets go over some of the issues with our accessibility
      and user design, and I'll come up with some solutions!
  bossText: {fileID: 1058766526}
  developerText: {fileID: 973887718}
